---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - CalorieAce"
  description="Read our privacy policy to understand how Calorie Calculator handles your data, cookies, and advertising."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-gray-soft">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 font-body text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This Privacy Policy explains how CalorieAce ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you use our website. By using this site, you agree to the terms described below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Our calorie, weight loss, and weight gain calculators run entirely in your browser. The age, weight, height, and activity data you enter is used only to perform the calculation on your device and is never sent to or stored on our servers.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may automatically collect limited technical data such as browser type, device type, and pages visited, through standard analytics and advertising tools described below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">3. Cookies and Advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site may display advertisements served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-forest underline">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may also use cookies for basic site analytics to understand how visitors use the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Our site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">5. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/contact-us" class="text-forest underline">Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>